# wave-sets-death.vrs: wave-sets D21's death (probe 6.1): an event unit kills Chaos (.devdie, the nearest unit as the
# killer) and the scoreboard counts 1 death. Runs last: the respawn screen is handled by hand.
# Needs: IncludeAdmins = true, no purge cooldown; NyarDevTools (.devdie).
ensure
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo ravine
expect-log \[DEV TP\] ravine
wait 4
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
mark
chat .nyar event start ws-three
expect-log event ws-three wave 1/3 timeout=30
wait 12
chat .devdie -1584807109 40
expect-log \[DEV DIE\] found=1
wait 5
shot full ws-dead
